"Noto\">응급상황 외에 교내(교외 학교 공식행사 포함)에서 안전사고 발생한 경우 의료지원실로 연락해 주세요.</font></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;\">교내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;\">교외 학교 공식행사 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;\">에서 안전사고가 발생한 경우 보험 청구가 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;\">보험 청구 절차는 의료지원실에서 안내해 드리며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;\">자세한 내용은 아래 이미지를 참고해 주세요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">📞 </span><span style=\"font-family:Noto;mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;\">의료지원실</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0